### 1. Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### 2. Add knowledge (repeat this request with your own documents)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/documents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Spring AI study memo",
  "content": "Spring AI offers portable model APIs, vector store abstractions, RAG support, and MCP integration. This project stores source documents in PostgreSQL and searchable chunks in Milvus.",
  "metadata": {
    "category": "spring-ai",
    "language": "en"
  }
}

### 3. Inspect retrieval without calling the chat model
GET http://localhost:8080/api/search?query=How does RAG work?&topK=5&similarityThreshold=0.3

### 4. RAG answer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "Spring AI에서 RAG 질문은 어떤 흐름으로 처리돼?",
  "topK": 5,
  "similarityThreshold": 0.3
}

### 5. Replace the ID with the documentId returned by request 2
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
